          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 150,
          "diagram": "b1-e44-hiking-in-the-mountains",
          "text": "A group of friends wants to spend a day in nature. Here are some activities they could do. Talk together about the different activities, and say which would be the best.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e44-hiking-in-the-mountains/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
